[00:17.08]1. There is a need in each heart
[00:22.08]God put within from the start:
[00:27.26]Yearning to know what life is for,
[00:32.14]Thirsting for something more.
[00:37.82]Though some may search in despair,
[00:43.00]God’s Word has always been there—
[00:48.28]Words that bring hope, joy that is real,
[00:53.28]Happiness I can feel.
[00:55.53](Chorus)
[00:57.78]I’ll praise Jehovah each day,
[01:00.78]Walk in his light, follow his way.
[01:06.28]I’ll give Jehovah my life,
[01:14.20]Trusting that he’ll provide.
[01:21.50]I will always feed
[01:25.59]My spiritual need.
[01:37.92]2. I know I need to make time
[01:43.00]Thinking on truths that I find,
[01:48.19]Feeding my faith, helping me see
[01:52.97]How to be truly free.
[01:58.65]Though some may choose to ignore,
[02:03.84]I’ll pray they open the door.
[02:09.12]Then they can feel true peace of mind,
[02:14.22]Happiness just like mine.
[02:16.47](Chorus)
[02:18.72]I’ll praise Jehovah each day,
[02:25.44]Walk in his light, follow his way.
[02:59.13]I’ll give Jehovah my life,
[03:14.88]Trusting that he’ll provide.
[03:20.88]I will always feed
[03:23.88]My spiritual need.
